        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"804318f7-907c-47fe-ae52-0175bc235d7a\",\"review_text\":\"Lopp lopppyou\"},{\"review_id\":\"4ef35a75-2144-46a8-af01-8b7e3b48d1d7\",\"review_text\":\"8.3.22 Good app. Would recommend this app. UPDATE AUG 11 WISH THE PROGRAMERS WOULD ADD SOMEWAY TO SHOW THAT WE ARE CONNECTED ON THE APP. I KEEP GET GETTING THROW OFF TO THE FREE 30 MIN TRIAL. I HAVE HAD MY ACCT FOR SOMETIME AND LOVE IT PLEASE FIX... UPDATE 11/11/22 No fix yet ... Dropped 1 Star🤨👇 I have completely uninstalled the app everything so again & I have reloaded the app. It Fingers Crossed Now ... Will let you know...?? 🤔🤔🤔\"},{\"review_id\":\"fa427a77-c443-4420-8b09-95a695cfe32c\",\"review_text\":\"we boycott this app\"},{\"review_id\":\"a9a42045-421d-4ca2-81cd-7217597d1649\",\"review_text\":\"Because I learn to sing the love song\"},{\"review_id\":\"2267e5a5-58f1-4aed-a171-de8a6e886e26\",\"review_text\":\"Quick and convenient, Spotify puts music at my fingertips. With a few taps, my favorite music goes along on walks or fills my home. I'm enjoying thos app.\"},{\"review_id\":\"80f3a524-856f-4bf9-8803-bacd83c50002\",\"review_text\":\"Worst app bring back the old features\"},{\"review_id\":\"0492b881-485d-491e-8752-40a5a11786ca\",\"review_text\":\"Terrible ads and way too annoying\"},{\"review_id\":\"681c7b86-7520-4886-bfe1-e9d670dacb1f\",\"review_text\":\"This app I la so good 🙂🙂\"},{\"review_id\":\"466edd18-60d5-4c09-a014-d62409b4e416\",\"review_text\":\"Just can't download to a file?\"},{\"review_id\":\"19568c83-dd1b-4bf4-aa6a-2deb1d74ec5d\",\"review_text\":\"FANTASTIC! Keeps me going through out the day. Rock 'n Roll, Easy Listening, Classical, 2000's to 2020's. All good..\"}]}"
